The Landsat-* Vale rules are adapted from the Portolan prose rules:

  https://github.com/portolan-sdi/portolan-ops
  commit 30e8ea74aeb428e563c1e823df0871e055ae5986

The adapted rules remain available under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
They were renamed and narrowed to this repository. The Portolan lexicon rules
(Spec, Formats, Urls, AiReady, Parts) were dropped, because they encode facts
about the Portolan project. Headings.yml carries this repository's exception
list, and Casing.yml adds the Landsat terms.
